# Test: the card viewer as the bestiary: LV and the level on the card's bar, the enemy's stats on the left.
# Jian gets the Quetzalcoatl, Sasquatch, and Dark Jian cards; X, Items, Cards, A opens the viewer (on a build
# where the Cards category still opens it); Down and Right move. Jian is level index 22 (LV 23).
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u8 0x0213BA29 1
poke u8 0x0213BA38 1
poke u32 0x020B4664 22
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot bc_00
press Down 6
wait 30
shot bc_01
press Up 6
wait 20
press Right 6
wait 30
shot bc_02
